</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.3 -3.53)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.67em;--ltx-fo-height:5.92em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="75.76" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 75.76)" width="213.36"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S2.F2.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:16.67em;">
<span id="S2.F2.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F2.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{audio}
<br class="ltx_break">Transcribe in {src language}
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S2.F2.p1.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">{transcription}
<br class="ltx_break"></span>Translate to {tgt language}
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S2.F2.p1.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">{translation}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
        
</div></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
<div id="S2.F2.4" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:169.1pt;">
          
<div id="S2.F2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S2.F2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="101.87" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 233.92 101.87" width="233.92"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,101.87) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#5D5D5D;" fill="#5D5D5D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.77 L 0 97.1 C 0 99.74 2.13 101.87 4.77 101.87 L 229.15 101.87 C 231.78 101.87 233.92 99.74 233.92 97.1 L 233.92 4.77 C 233.92 2.13 231.78 0 229.15 0 L 4.77 0 C 2.13 0 0 2.13 0 4.77 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F5F5F5;" fill="#F5F5F5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 4.77 L 0.83 81.27 L 233.09 81.27 L 233.09 4.77 C 233.09 2.59 231.32 0.83 229.15 0.83 L 4.77 0.83 C 2.59 0.83 0.83 2.59 0.83 4.77 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#5D5D5D;" fill="#5D5D5D" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 82.1 L 0.83 97.1 C 0.83 99.28 2.59 101.04 4.77 101.04 L 229.15 101.04 C 231.32 101.04 233.09 99.28 233.09 97.1 L 233.09 82.1 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.3 88.45)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.67em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="213.36"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S2.F2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:16.67em;">
<span id="S2.F2.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F2.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Direct Prompt Template</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.3 -3.53)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:16.67em;--ltx-fo-height:5.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="72.99" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 72.99)" width="213.36"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S2.F2.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:16.67em;">
<span id="S2.F2.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.F2.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{audio}
<br class="ltx_break">Translate to {tgt language}
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S2.F2.p2.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">{translation}
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
        
</div></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 2: </span>Prompt templates (model outputs are in bold)</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="S2.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S2.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">To fully leverage ASR and T2TT performance in S2TT, <span id="S2.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">CoT</span> models use prompts derived from the template shown in Figure <a href="#S2.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ 2.2 Speech Translation Model ‣ 2 Methodology ‣ Revisiting Direct Speech-to-Text Translation with Speech LLMs: Better Scaling than CoT Prompting?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. The same template is applied during inference, and generation is performed with beam search using five beams.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="S3" class="ltx_section">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_section"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_section">3 </span>Experimental Setup</h2>

<section id="S3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.1 </span>Data</h3>

<div id="S3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our training framework includes four types of datasets: ASR, T2TT, S2TT and pseudo-labeled S2TT (S2TT<sub id="S3.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_sub">pl</sub>) in six languages: Catalan (<span id="S3.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">ca</span>), German (<span id="S3.SS1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">de</span>), English (<span id="S3.SS1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">en</span>), Spanish (<span id="S3.SS1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">es</span>), French (<span id="S3.SS1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">fr</span>), and Italian (<span id="S3.SS1.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">it</span>). Table <a href="#S3.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 3.1 Data ‣ 3 Experimental Setup ‣ Revisiting Direct Speech-to-Text Translation with Speech LLMs: Better Scaling than CoT Prompting?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> reports the amount of data per language. For ASR, we use the train splits of Common Voice 21.0 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">17</a>]</cite> and Multilingual LibriSpeech <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>]</cite>, totaling approximately 6,000 and 48,900 hours, respectively. For T2TT, we use Wikimedia <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib19" title="" class="ltx_ref">19</a>]</cite> samples with 5 to 100 words, filtered using the same pipeline applied to pseudo-labeled S2TT data. For S2TT, we consider the train splits of Europarl-ST v1.1 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">20</a>]</cite> and CoVoST 2 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite>, totaling around 630 and 1,600 hours, respectively. Finally, S2TT<sub id="S3.SS1.p1.1.8" class="ltx_sub">pl</sub> data is generated by translating all Common Voice 21.0 samples into all possible target languages. We evaluate our models in CoVoST 2 and Fleurs <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">22</a>]</cite> test sets.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T1" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Amount of data per language and total target tokens (considering transcriptions and translations as target in S2TT). The number of hours for S2TT<sub id="S3.T1.7" class="ltx_sub">pl</sub> corresponds to repeated utterances (one for each of the five target languages).</figcaption>
